ty dealers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auctions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store expansion and customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House purchasing and decoration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection book</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily orders</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online 1-4 player co-op</strong> </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808920/extras/81ba2705df56d246577ece4b85a522a7.poster.avif?t=1786254536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808920/extras/81ba2705df56d246577ece4b85a522a7.webm?t=1786254536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808920/extras/81ba2705df56d246577ece4b85a522a7.mp4?t=1786254536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808920/extras/7eb4843d57b5fc96b05bcd824a4f7ae5.avif?t=1786254536\" width=856 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the depot, inspect the clues, and grab the best boxes before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808920/extras/179fb82b7dfb8a9e5e949072639e3abc.poster.avif?t=1786254536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4808920/extras/179fb82b7dfb8a9e5e949072639e3abc.webm?t=1786254536\" type=